      "content": "thanks for this. looking at it now, the density is decent, but i'm worried it's a bit too concise. the supervisor's report usually expects a more comprehensive \"deep-dive\" into the mechanistic details to really drive that density score up.\n\ncan you expand on this? i need more detail on the biochemical pathways and the structural roles of the components mentioned. try to go really deep into the technical side to make sure the density score is high enough for the brief, but again, keep it scientifically accurate. don't just list terms, but really flesh out the mechanism using the appropriate terminology.",
